   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "MEASURED: StrictDoc's\ndefault REQUIREMENT is\neight fields and NONE is\nmandatory. required-ness\nis a per-project\ndeclaration, not a vendor\nopinion. that is the\nwhole reason the catalog\nis separate from the\nregister.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "MEASURED: StrictDoc's\ndefault REQUIREMENT is\neight fields and NONE is\nmandatory. required-ness\nis a per-project\ndeclaration, not a vendor\nopinion. that is the\nwhole reason the catalog\nis separate from the\nregister.",
