   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "A link is an object with a type \u2014 never a column",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r1023",
   "originalText": "A link is an object with a type \u2014 never a column",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1025",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 678,
   "y": 911,
   "width": 422.40000000000003,
   "height": 210.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0025",
   "seed": 17175,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33325,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "ReqIF SpecRelation: TYPE, SOURCE and TARGET are ALL MANDATORY.\na relation cannot be untyped. it is a first-class object beside\nthe requirement, not an attribute of it.\n\nStrictDoc: ROLE must be REGISTERED IN THE GRAMMAR - 'ROLE:\nRefines' was refused until declared - and REVERSE_ROLE means one\ndeclaration gives BOTH reading directions.\n\n  depends-on / required-by      supersedes / superseded-by\n  satisfied-by / satisfies      verified-by / verifies\n  refines / refined-by\n\nthe producer's single 'Trace Links:' field is four different\nrelations in one bag. TECH-006 is a LINK TYPE, not a column.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "ReqIF SpecRelation: TYPE, SOURCE and TARGET are ALL MANDATORY.\na relation cannot be untyped. it is a first-class object beside\nthe requirement, not an attribute of it.\n\nStrictDoc: ROLE must be REGISTERED IN THE GRAMMAR - 'ROLE:\nRefines' was refused until declared - and REVERSE_ROLE means one\ndeclaration gives BOTH reading directions.\n\n  depends-on / required-by      supersedes / superseded-by\n  satisfied-by / satisfies      verified-by / verifies\n  refines / refined-by\n\nthe producer's single 'Trace Links:' field is four different\nrelations in one bag. TECH-006 is a LINK TYPE, not a column.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1026",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 847,
   "width": 165.0,
   "height": 120.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0026",
   "seed": 17182,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33338,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "this kills two columns\nfrom the seven: Depends\nand Superseded by both\nbecome links.\n\nand it gives supersession\na typed edge instead of a\nprose convention.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "this kills two columns\nfrom the seven: Depends\nand Superseded by both\nbecome links.\n\nand it gives supersession\na typed edge instead of a\nprose convention.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
