   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "One model, many renderings \u2014 the 15-vs-7 tension dissolves",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "r1030",
   "originalText": "One model, many renderings \u2014 the 15-vs-7 tension dissolves",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1032",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 678,
   "y": 1265,
   "width": 435.6,
   "height": 165.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0032",
   "seed": 17224,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33416,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "StrictDoc stores named VISIBLE_FIELDS sets as data. the model\ncarries every field the producer's row names; a VIEW decides\nwhich of them a given surface shows.\n\n  card      ID \u00b7 Category \u00b7 State \u00b7 Requirement       (the board)\n  table     + Depends \u00b7 Source                        (the file)\n  full      every declared field                      (one record)\n  release   ID \u00b7 Title \u00b7 State \u00b7 release              (planning)\n\nso the argument was never 15 versus 7. it was ONE MODEL versus\nONE RENDERING, and we had conflated them.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "StrictDoc stores named VISIBLE_FIELDS sets as data. the model\ncarries every field the producer's row names; a VIEW decides\nwhich of them a given surface shows.\n\n  card      ID \u00b7 Category \u00b7 State \u00b7 Requirement       (the board)\n  table     + Depends \u00b7 Source                        (the file)\n  full      every declared field                      (one record)\n  release   ID \u00b7 Title \u00b7 State \u00b7 release              (planning)\n\nso the argument was never 15 versus 7. it was ONE MODEL versus\nONE RENDERING, and we had conflated them.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "t1033",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 1201,
   "width": 165.0,
   "height": 105.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0033",
   "seed": 17231,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 33429,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1785400000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "UX-006 - 'avoid reading\nlots of text' - is a VIEW\nrequirement, not a schema\nrequirement. it was\nshrinking the model when\nit should have been\nchoosing a view.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "UX-006 - 'avoid reading\nlots of text' - is a VIEW\nrequirement, not a schema\nrequirement. it was\nshrinking the model when\nit should have been\nchoosing a view.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
